### BiAN Positioning

**Strengths that push above SoloPose/SimE/OT-FL:**
- Sharp, novel problem formulation (internal contradiction in CODA's approach) — more incisive than typical motivation
- Results are plausible and strong (42.3 MAE on SHB→SHA vs. 110.2 for next-best DA; occasionally surpassing supervised methods)
- 8 dataset combinations is broad coverage; meaningful ablation showing CM contributes −12.9 MAE improvement
- No factual misrepresentation or misleading framing (unlike SimE's "thousands of parameters" and easier-problem comparison)
