**Calibration anchors:** Papers scoring 6 (Accept Poster) like `hj323oR3rw`, `LuVulfPgZN`, `NJxCpMt0sf` have sound methodology with minor gaps and consistent results. This paper falls short on ablation completeness and has unexplained counter-results. Papers scoring 5 (borderline reject) like `IT7LSnBdtY` have comparable experimental gaps. This paper lands at the low end of borderline territory.

