### Relative positioning

- **Clearly above** SMIA (3.5 avg) and EM-MIA (3.75 avg): Set-MI doesn't suffer from fundamental evaluation confounds (same as SMIA), and doesn't fail on standard benchmarks (like EM-MIA). The method is principled and the paper is well-structured.
